                     other. 기본값 throws away every colour on this page, and the
                     two were once neighbours a single button-width apart, which
                     is the miss that costs the whole palette - the width of this
                     window now stands between them instead, and it is wider than
                     the button-width that used to. The confirm prompt stays
                     either way.

                     닫기 was deliberately absent until 2026-08-26: the title bar
                     already carries an X, and a second way out crowded the
                     buttons that do the work. The page has since grown to
                     twenty-six rows, so the row it would have crowded is now
                     mostly empty - the reason went away with the width (asked
                     for by the author, who reaches the bottom of this page and
                     wants the way out there). Esc still closes it through
                     ColorSettingsWindow_PreviewKeyDown, which gives the picker
                     first refusal on the key, so this button carries no
                     IsCancel of its own. -->
                <Grid Grid.Row="28"
                        Grid.Column="0"
